WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.704
Do your tools talk to each other?

00:00:02.604 --> 00:00:05.651
Or are you copying the same details,

00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:06.888
again and again?

00:00:07.258 --> 00:00:10.560
Inbox to spreadsheet to CRM.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.868
When your tools don't talk,

00:00:12.768 --> 00:00:16.687
you become the connection.

00:00:17.057 --> 00:00:19.037
We connect them,

00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:22.363
hands-on and working directly with you,

00:00:22.263 --> 00:00:25.252
so the work flows on its own.

00:00:25.622 --> 00:00:27.974
AI makes building software faster,

00:00:27.874 --> 00:00:31.691
so simple connections start from £350.
